  "limits": [
    "Unit and synthetic persistence only. No real Auth/member access, PostgreSQL/RLS, transaction/race, provider or end-to-end execution.",
    "Retained fixtures use public pure builders but owner commitments and claims/journals are synthetic; not authentic owner-write provenance.",
