    "Existing raw adapter obtains one repeatable snapshot but does not set SQL READ ONLY; this change adds no persistence method or isolation policy.",
    "New query is member-authorized archive access, not original-submitter/current-owner fresh admission. Complete tuples do not prove authoritative storage enumeration.",
    "Counts overlap. Old oracle and historical evidence files unchanged; comparison copies wrote only fresh stage2 outputs.",
    "Stage1 recovery remains active. New archive query has no route or export caller; correction and fresh writers remain deferred. No foreign Archive-owner behavior, SQL, HTTP, commit, push or CI action.",
    "Evidence-only receipt 3efa and Governance fixture b61 are separate preceding commits. No results from terminal CI38026082849 are transferred to this source slice; next ordinary PR CI must test the new head.",
